rs/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1011,"digest":"sha256:323bbb9971060a1068ca5a074e80ae2b02f697d8ba0fd92ad8568a9a2b14d229","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T08:54:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T08:54:07Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/aburan28/crypto/releases/download/v0.1.2372/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aburan28/crypto/tarball/v0.1.2372","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aburan28/crypto/zipball/v0.1.2372","body":"Rolling build of `main`.\n\n| Artifact | Contents |\n| --- | --- |\n| `crypto-*-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz` | `crypto`, `ic`, `ecbench`, `curve_cover_check`, `hyperelliptic-cover` — glibc |\n| `crypto-*-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz` | same five executables — static |\n| `crypto-*-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` | same five executables — Apple silicon |\n| `crypto-*-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip` | same five executables (`.exe`) |\n| `isogeny-*-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz` | dedicated `isogeny` executable, README, BUILD.json — glibc |\n| `isogeny-*-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz` | dedicated tool — static |\n| `isogeny-*-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz` | dedicated tool — Apple silicon |\n| `isogeny-*-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip` | dedicated `isogeny.exe` tool |\n| `ecc2k130-cpu-*.tar.gz` | ECC2K-130 client, CPU (`-march=x86-64-v3`) |\n| `ecc2k130-cuda-*.tar.gz` | ECC2K-130 client, CUDA fatbinary (sm_80–sm_120) |\n\nVerify with `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS`.\n\nRun `isogeny --help` after extracting the dedicated tool archive.\n`isogeny search --curve p224 --ell 1471 --out p224-1471` constructs\nand independently verifies the recorded one-eigenline map.\n\nThe CUDA binary is compiled, not GPU-tested: GitHub runners have no GPU.\n\nBuilt from commit 3714752ee6a9686e0fce79cb308423d9fd09cde9.\n"}